- **The fix:** Home's readiness selector is now `.home-card--needs`, the card in `apps/web/src/screens/Home.tsx:60-61`. It mounts only once all four reads have resolved, in the same render as the Stuck, Health and WIP sections. So W-675-b3 can no longer check or screenshot Home's loading shell.
